        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' fuga Misri gwariteawa buuneeda jeeda ng'eanyiida nea ghwalamwach geat, nea geeyi, “Inyas ea meeweayeeni gajeemeewa sean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwasar buuneeda dearanga nganooyda nyaawa damanda miyeayiina jeeda gidamwataw ea dabitida sisina mukaateehiin geayiin jeesinga shageeniga nyaawa ak geayiin gheatkweaka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasinda fuga Israeli gidarukusiinda Musa saawa, ak geegasa aba heeda fuga Misri dabita sisna gharinga sisina lapiya ea dabita sisna dahaabu ea hang'weaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA ghwanyas gheamamda fuga Israeli aba heeda fuga Misri, inyeesa gil mus sean geataw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli gwariteawa Misri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada fuga Israeli ng'eanyiida Ramesi ea ghwahita Sukoti, abeeda mooneeda buuneeda weewa geeshanga ea sagalamnyooji lah nea meeyiita gadeemga ea diibiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwascheang'da gaweay nea gaguuyi eemeetuw adeayi saawa, ea dugwa saang'a, sea gisilga ea haleanjeeda saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iidu geesin mukaateeyda meamwatawiida sisna dearanga ghayi siyaat damanda sirina Misri, abeeda miyeamwatawiit aba gideaba gwariteawa Misri nea gwajirjir abeeda miyeewu gichea eayaak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli goobiida ng'eanyiida Misri gweanyeew bughalaji ang'wan ea diktam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudeanoodeaba gweanyeeksu as bughalaji ang'wan ea diktam ea damanamughuushiin eaweeda riteawa lugooda NG'UTAMIIDA ng'eanyiida Misrihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedida ghoang'wearu NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba gooruuna saawa ng'eanyiida Misri, ak nih ea eaweeda NG'UTAMIIDA gil, ak gammiisa gideaba gaygoopkeadi fuga Israeli sean ea ghoah seaygoojiga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gichea ghabeada Sinooda Basaaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa ea Haruni, “Nih gichea ghabeada sinooda Basaaka gil, rabascheanda adaghwaak hamita Basaaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geaghus gilinyoo ea soomjeanda gil, sishaaha lapiya gayghanyi aada ghasmeahooda ayiila niny, ak abeeda ghwaak hamita Basaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak rabascheanda ghana siida gadiyeeda ak mushaahara, adaghwaak hamita Basaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamita gajeeyeaksa jeemba ghawagi, ak ea adeeruuta banyeega jarooda nea adeehirja geapkeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak dasina ng'asheanji fuga sean bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iimida buunyeanda mida jeedeang'wa ak gagasa gwasissa NG'UTAMIIDA basaaka, gammiisa ghanyi ghwaat headiga mida gheanyi sean ghasmeahooda eeyiil, ak abeeda gwaneekiit gwasin Basaaka, ak abeeda gaygawuurji sea siida bea ng'eanyiida. Sighus siida miyeayaat ghasmeahooda eeyiil adaghwaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 12:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Digheanjagi aba badayda siida bea ng'eanyiida ea buunyeanda mida jeedeang'wa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.12.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.12.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
